    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the world of puzzles in the new exciting game Find All Things! Play a variety of mini-games in different themed locations, from Japan to a car repair shop. Look for hidden objects, find pairs, solve puzzles, enjoy match-3 games or train your memory, all in one game. Complete levels to receive coins that you can spend on collectibles to furnish your room. This game has something fun for everyone!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093230/extras/58c0b4f5b6d5d4014fa4e84fd86d0107.poster.avif?t=1737130304\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093230/extras/58c0b4f5b6d5d4014fa4e84fd86d0107.webm?t=1737130304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093230/extras/58c0b4f5b6d5d4014fa4e84fd86d0107.mp4?t=1737130304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on an exciting journey with a variety of mini-games and puzzles that will never let you get bored.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game features:</strong></h2>\u2714 Play 84 different levels in 21 themed locations<br>\u2714 Find hidden objects and match pairs<br>\u2714 Relax and unwind with soothing gameplay<br>\u2714 Build puzzles and solve various brain teasers<br>\u2714 Decorate the room with collectibles<br>\u2714 Discover tons of great desktop wallpapers<br>\u2714 Listen to game tunes in the music player",
